factcheck by anthropic/claude-haiku-5-5: 5 problems
  The caption's "📰 முழு விவரம்" section and the reel_script say the limit was fixed by the central government 'across the country', but the article states it was set by the central government for nationalised banks; the caption adds 'தேசிய மயமாக்கப்பட்ட வங்கிகளில்', which is accurate, while the reel_script omits this, so the scope of the limit is slightly altered.
  The reel_script says the farmers' loan limit 'should be changed' (மாற்ற வேண்டும்) at the start, but the article only says the limit should be fixed based on cultivated area; the claim of a demand to change it generally is not stated in that form.
  The tamil_headline reads 'பயிர் கடன் வரம்பை பயிர் பரப்பை கணக்கிட்டு நிர்ணயிக்க கோரிக்கை' – the phrasing is grammatically awkward (repeated 'பயிர்' and 'பரப்பை' with unclear object relationship) and the headline's 'நாமக்கல்:' prefix is attached to a demand made by a state-level leader, which is acceptable, but the wording is not a clear Tamil sentence.
  The reel_script states the demand is for the limit to be set 'அதன் அடிப்படையில்' for the whole country, while the article says the central government should calculate cultivated area nationwide; the reel_script also omits the important fact that the demand is for the limit to be set on area basis for future periods (இனிவரும் காலங்களில), which is a missing time qualifier.
  The slides_spec line 'நாமக்கல்லில் இருந்து தெரிவிக்கப்பட்ட கோரிக்கை' says the demand was made 'from Namakkal', which is a reasonable reading of the dateline but the slide 'யார் கோரிக்கை?' lists the speaker's role as state leader without the organisation's name being clear as 'Tamil Nadu Farmers' Association', and the slide 'மத்திய அரசு நாடு முழுவதும் இதை நிர்ணயித்துள்ளது' is accurate.
